  (text
    "bzzy LED ring: 16 x WS2812B-2020 around the Waveshare ESP32-S3-Touch-LCD-1.69"
    (at 25 20 0)
    (effects (font (size 2.5 2.5)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 79f2961a-b469-49fc-a3bb-4d8f8eb2bc63))
  (text
    "J1 is four wire holes on the left side (GPIO18, 5V, GND, GPIO17). Wire them to the Waveshare board's pads."
    (at 25 25 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid edfc2ffa-5db7-4b64-8511-343eb4f9103c))
  (text
    "U1 lifts the 3.3 V data to 5 V logic. R1 keeps the line low while the ESP32 boots. R3 limits ESD current into GPIO18."
    (at 25 45 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 92ead4af-48a2-4370-ba9e-667f47d550c6))
  (text
    "LED chain: D1 (bottom, left of centre) runs clockwise to D16. TP1 is the chain's DOUT, for adding more LEDs later."
    (at 25 108 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 3ee73921-6469-402d-87d5-dc1c0264c507))
  (sheet_instances (path "/" (page "1"))))
